@startuml
title SD-A03 — Deployment and middleware
caption To-Be draft | F01–F08 · Delivery / Operations
node "HTTPS edge" as Edge
node "Application runtime" {
 [Next.js web process] as Web
 [FastAPI process] as API
 [Independent Python worker] as Worker
}
database "PostgreSQL: transactions and durable work" as Db
cloud "Encrypted private object store" as Blob
cloud "OTP and notice providers" as Msg
Edge --> Web : same origin
Web --> API : private versioned HTTP
API --> Db : bounded role-specific pool
Worker --> Db : lease and conditional completion
API --> Blob : upload and authorized read
API --> Msg : OTP with deadline
Worker --> Msg : notice attempt / outcome
@enduml
